        "kind": "home",
        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Menu](/menu) · [Find us](/find-us)\n\nWe use cookies to analyse traffic. [Got it]\n\n# Harbour Beans\n\n**Specialty coffee and fresh bagels on the Gustavia waterfront.**\n\nWe roast small batches every week and bake our bagels at dawn. Dog friendly, laptop friendly, sunrise friendly.\n\n## Opening hours\n\nMon–Sat 7:30am to 2pm. Closed on Sundays.\n\n## What we do\n\n- Pour-over and espresso drinks\n- Bagels, sandwiches and salads\n- Cold brew by the bottle\n- Catering for boats and villas (order 24h ahead)\n\nFree wifi, outdoor seating, oat and almond milk available.\n\n## What people say\n\n\"Best flat white on the island, hands down.\" — Jenna R.\n\n## Find us\n\nHarbour Beans, Rue de la République, Gustavia 97133\nPhone: +590 590 00 23 45 · hello@harbourbeans.example\n\nWe take cards, cash and Apple Pay.\n\n© Harbour Beans 2024 · [Privacy](/privacy)"
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "url": "https://harbourbeans.example/menu",
        "kind": "menu",
        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Menu](/menu) · [Find us](/find-us)\n\n# Menu\n\nAll prices in euros, tax included.\n\n## Coffee\n\n- Espresso — €2.80\n- Flat white — €4.50\n- Cold brew (bottle) — €6\n- Iced latte — €5\n\n## Bagels\n\n- Plain with cream cheese — €5.50\n- Smoked salmon and dill — €12\n- Avocado, egg and chili — €11\n\n## Sweet\n\n- Banana bread — €4\n- Cinnamon roll — €4.50\n\nCatering platters from €120 for 10 people.\n\n© Harbour Beans"
